history.prompt:
Use case: illustration-story. Asset: ONE landscape 4:3 painting for The Burnt Book. Native canvas must be landscape 4:3, not square; show the whole scene without borders.
Style: Refined Indian watercolour with restrained gouache on warm ivory paper, organic detail, quiet ochre, sage, dusty terracotta and muted indigo, soft natural light. Warm and gentle; spirits are luminous and kind, never frightening. Phone-first composition: the main subject grouped in the centre, quiet margins. Text appears only where the brief asks for it, and then exactly as given.
Exact narrative scene: Early morning in the temple library: Śuka the parrot at an open window with the sunrise behind him, beak wide open mid-squawk, wings half spread; Dādī at the reading desk lowering her round spectacles with one eyebrow raised, amused; Dhūmaka giggling as a little puff of smoke beside the glowing leaf.
Fixed character appearances: {"shuka":"A bright green rose-ringed parrot with a red beak and a faint pink and black neck ring, a little scruffy, very expressive eyes; usually on your shoulder or Dādī's.","dadi":"A warm, sharp-eyed grandmother in her seventies, silver hair in a low bun, round spectacles, a cream cotton sari with a thin maroon border and a grey shawl; carries a cloth-bound notebook.","dhumaka":"A small, round, smoke-grey spirit about the height of a child's knee, with big kind dark eyes and a wavy, wispy lower edge like lamp smoke."}
Place: {"granthalaya":"An old stone library beside a temple: carved wooden shelves of palm-leaf bundles, brass oil lamps, a low reading desk, an arched doorway onto the courtyard with the temple spire beyond."}
All main subjects grouped in the central 60 percent width with generous quiet surrounding environment; readable on a phone. Show the young learner only from behind, no face. The smoke spirit Dhūmaka has a round smoke-grey floating body, big kind dark eyes and a curling wispy lower edge, as a warm storybook character. Dādī has silver hair low bun, round glasses, cream sari thin maroon border and grey shawl. No readable or simulated lettering, fake script, watermark, UI, or frame. Where glowing manuscript marks are mentioned, use soft light and blank/indistinct texture without letter shapes.
